#: src/Pro__premium_only/Seo/ReturnsForm.php:75
msgid "The club’s returns and delivery time. There are deliberately no default values: details appear on product pages and in the data for Google and AI search only once you enter them and approve them below. The texts must match your terms and conditions and withdrawal notice (“Legal & warranty” section) – have them legally reviewed if in doubt."
